      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d still be inclined to use `thiserror` to define an error struct or enum wrapping the value you get from `errno`, but if there\u0027s only one user of this library and you don\u0027t anticipate it being useful to anyone else then it doesn\u0027t matter that much.",
